This package incorporates and builds on three upstream MIT-licensed projects:

- shadcn/ui — Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn — https://ui.shadcn.com
  Component source (src/components/ui/*.tsx) is generated from and derived
  from the shadcn/ui registry.

- Astryx — Copyright (c) 2026 Meta Platforms, Inc. — https://github.com/facebook/astryx
  Design tokens (colors, radius, font families) in src/styles/globals.css are
  sourced from the published @astryxdesign/theme-neutral and
  @astryxdesign/theme-stone npm packages.

- Magic UI — https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui
  A curated set of animated components (animated-beam.tsx, bento-grid.tsx,
  border-beam.tsx, confetti.tsx, marquee.tsx, number-ticker.tsx,
  shimmer-button.tsx) are adapted from the Magic UI registry.

See README.md for full attribution details.
